Homepage: https://github.com/Genotomi/erikos

Package: erik-base
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, erik-archive-keyring
Recommends: fastfetch
Description: Erik OS system identity shared by every edition
 Identifies the system as Erik OS through os-release while keeping
 ID_LIKE=debian, so Debian tools keep working. Debian's own
 os-release is kept under a dpkg diversion and comes back when this
 package is removed.
 .
 Also ships the Erik ASCII logo and makes it the fastfetch logo.
 .
 Desktop and server editions depend on this package.
